  "verseCount": 57,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki, mosinto o Yerubi‐Baali, akageenda Sekemu, ase abaang’inarome, na ase abanto bonsi b’eamate ya ise ng’ina, akabateebia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng’a ’mbaborie abanto ba Sekemu, “Inki kere ekiya kobua, ng’a abana abamura emerongo etano n’ebere ba Yerubi‐Baali baabagaambere, gose omonto oyomo bweka abagaambere? Inyora boigo ng’a Abimeleki nigo are oyomino bw’amanyinga ayamo kegima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio aba’ng’inarome bagakwana amang’ana ayio ase abanto ba Sekemu ase ogokoonya Abimeleki, na bonsi bakang’uswa bakaba ase ensemo yaye, naende bagateeba ng’a ere n’oyomwabo orenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakamoa chisekeli chi’echifeta emerongo etano n’ebere korwa ase enyomba ya Baali‐Beriti, na ase chitaabu echio akabagora abanto abatantanu bateechigeti: nabarabwo bakamotunyana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio akageenda nyomba mwa ise agwo Ofura, na igoro ase rigena erimo akabaita abamura bamwabo aroro, abana ba Yerubi‐Baali, emerongo etano n’ebere. Yotamu bweka, omomura omoke kegima o Yerubi‐Baali, nere otigarete ore moyo. Ere konya bwebisire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto bonsi ba Sekemu, na abwo ba Beti‐Milo, bagasangererekana amo agwo Sekemu ase Omoaluni ang’e nekeinyorio giatenenirieo, na agwo bakabeeka Abimeleki akaba omorwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yotamu ateebetigwe amang’ana ayio, akageenda, agatenena ase egetunwa kia Gerisimu igoro, agaaka eriogi rinene agateeba, “Inwe abanto ba Sekemu, ntegerera, erinde Nyasae nere abategerere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo kare ekaba ng’a emete ekageenda gochoora erwoti ekoyegambera. Egateebia omozeituni: Togambere!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omozeituni oria okairaneria: Inee! Nigo ’ngotiga amaguta ane ayakorenta ogosika ase chinyasae na ase Mwanyabaanto, erinde ’ngambere emete ende?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio emete egateebia omoko: Inchuo aye otogambere!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omoko oria okairaneria: Nigo ’ngotiga obwansu bwane n’amatunda ane amaya, erinde ’ngambere emete ende?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emete egateebia omosabibu: Inchuo aye otogambere!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omosabibu okairaneria: Nigo ’ngotiga okorua edivai yane, eria ekogokia chinyasae na Mwanyabaanto, erinde ’ngambere emete ende?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio emete yonsi egateebia egetutu ki’amagwa: Inchuo aye otogambere!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na egetutu ki’amagwa gekairaneria emete yonsi: Onye ekeene mwanchire gonchoora imbe omogambi oino, inchwo mokenderere inse y’ekiriri kiane, korende onye taibo, tiga omorero osoke korwa ase chinsagia chiane chi’amagwa, osambe emecharake ya Lebanoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na bono, Inee, nigo ’mwakorete ayaare boronge na ay’obwegenwa ekero mwachoorete Abimeleki akaba omorwoti oino? Naende ’mwakorerete Yerubi‐Baali na ab’enyomba yaye boronge na ay’amogwenerete ase ogokora kwaye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyora ng’a nigo arwanete esegi ase engencho yaino. Nigo ebeegete ang’e ase ogokwa ase okobatooria korwa ase Abamidiani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reero inwe mwabeire mamincha y’enyomba ya tata, na mwaiteire abana baye abamura, abanto emerongo etano n’ebere, ase rigena erimo igoro, naende mwabeekire Abimeleki, omwana bw’omosomba oye omokungu, obeire omorwoti bw’ abanto ba Sekemu, ekiagera are momura omino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye reero mwakoreire Yerubi‐Baali amo nab’enyomba yaye ayaare boronge nay’obwegenwa, rirorio gookera Abimeleki, nere tiga abagookere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye taibo, tiga omorero osoke korwa ase Abimeleki obasambe inwe abamomenyete Sekemu na Beti‐Milo, obasirie; naende tiga omorero osoke korwa ase more inwe abamomenyete Sekemu na Beti‐Milo, osambe Abimeleki, omosirie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yotamu akamonyoka, agatama gochia Beeri, akamenya agwo, ekiagera airogete Abimeleki momura omwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki akagaambera Abaisraeli ase engaki y’emiaka etato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nyasae agatoma omoika omobe ase ogwatanan’Abimeleki n’abanto ba Sekemu, n’abanto aba bagakorera Abimeleki obong’ainereria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nigo abeete bo, erinde obobe obwo bwakoreretwe abana abamura baria ba Yerubi‐Baali emerongo etano n’ebere boakanerwe egesiomba. Ase igo okomocha kw’ogoiterwa kw’amanyinga abo kogaakanerwa igoro y’Abimeleki, oyio obaitete, naende igoro y’ abanto ba Sekemu, abwo bamobegete chinguru chi’ogokora ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Sekemu bakabeeka abanto ase ebitunwa igoro baboere abanto bonsi barenge goeta ase chinchera chiria na kobaura ebinto biabo. Abimeleki agateebigwa amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali, mosinto bw’Ebedi, agacha Sekemu amo n’abamura bamwabo, n’abanto ba Sekemu bakamwegena na komosemeria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bonsi bakageenda ase emegondo y’emesabibu, bagatora amasabibu, bakayamita, bakaroisia edivai na gokora omoyega omonene. Bagasoa ase enyomba y’enyasae yabo, bakaria na konywa, erio bakaragereria Abimeleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali, mosinto bw’Ebedi agateeba, “Abimeleki nere ng’o? Naintwe, abanto ba Sekemu, ’mbanto ki tore? Nase ki togokorera Abimeleki? Ere mosinto o Yerubi‐Baali! Na Sebuli, nere omoteneneri bw’ abanto baye! Nase ki rende togokorera Abimeleki? Taibo, tobe abegenwa ase abanto barwete Hamori, sokoro y’ abanto ba Sekemu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye abanto aba ’nkoba barenge ase oborendi bwane, anga ’narusia Abimeleki. Nigo nare komoteebia: Menta abarwani bao b’esegi, erio ochiche korwana!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Sebuli, omogambi bw’omochie oria, aigwete amang’ana a Gaali, mosinto bw’Ebedi, akaba n’endamwamu enene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatoma abanto gochia ase Abimeleki bobisi bamoteebie, “Gaali, mosinto bw’Ebedi, amo nabamura bamwabo bachire Sekemu, goseegeta abanto b’omochie babe mamincha yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aye amo n’abanto bao more komo, geenda botuko mwebise, moboe ase ebitii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ankio mambia, ekero erioba rigosoka, moimoke bwango, moumokere omochie. Erio ekero Gaali n’abanto baria bare komo bakobaachera kobarwania, mobakorere buna amaboko aino aranyare ekero ekio!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki amo n’abanto bonsi barenge komo bakaimoka botuko, bakebisa, bakaboera Sekemu, bare ebiombe bine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali agasoka, agatenena ase egeita ki’omochie, na erio agwo Abimeleki amo n’abanto baye bakaimoka korwa ase baaboete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Gaali arooche abanto, agateebia Sebuli, “Rigereria, abanto bagotirimboka korwa ebitunwa igoro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Korende Sebuli agateeba, “Ebio n’ebiiriiri bi’ebitunwa kwarorire bikororekana buna abanto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali agakwana naende, agateeba, “Yaya, rigereria, abanto ’ngotirimboka bare korwa ase rigwamu ria gati‐gati, n’abanto b’ekeombe kende nigo bagoocha ase enchera ekorwa ase omote oria bw’abaringoria Omoaluni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Sebuli akamoteebia, “Ng’ai are amang’ana ao ay’ogwetogia ekero gwateebete: Abimeleki nere ng’o? Nase ki tokomokorera? Aba tibari abanto baria gwachayete? Soka bono obarwanie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaali agatang’ana abanto ba Sekemu, na barabwo bakageenda bakarwania Abimeleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki agaseeria Gaali, na ere agatama. Abange bagaitwa, bakarambereria inse goika ase egeita ki’omochie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki akaira na Aruma, na Sebuli agaseeria Gaali na abamura bamwabo, erio tibanyaara kogenderera komenya Sekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere abanto bagasoka ase egetii aarabu, n’Abimeleki agateebigwa amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akaimoka n’abanto baye, akabaatanana ase ebiombe bitato, barabwo bakebisa na koboa ase egetii. Ekero arooche abanto bagosooka korwa ase omochie, agasooka korwa aase ebisete, akabaumokera na kobaita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki n’abanto b’ekeombe kiaye bakaayerera gochia gotenena ase egeita ki’omochie, korende abanto b’ebiombe biria bibere binde bakabarindokera na kobaumokera abanto bonsi barenge ase egetii, bakabaita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero Abimeleki arwanetie omochie rituko riria rigima, akayobwata na agaita abanto abamenyeteo. Erio akayoiyeria na koyoitororera omonyoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto bonsi b’Omorobiri o Sekemu baigwete amang’ana ayio, bakebisa ime ase ekenunchi kiarenge obotamero obokong’u agwo ase Hekalu ya Eli‐Beriti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki agateebigwa ng’a abanto bonsi b’Omorobiri o Sekemu nigo bagasangererekanete amo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agatiirera egetunwa gia Salimoni amo n’abanto baye bonsi. Akaimokia egesire, akageecha chinsagia chi’emete, agachibeeka ase amareko aye. Naende agateebia abanto baye, “Aya morarore inche ’ngokora, nainwe mokore boigo, na moyakore bwango!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo, kera oyomo ase abanto baria akageecha chinsagia chiaye; erio bagatunyan’Abimeleki, bakabeeka emete eria ang’e ase obotamero boria obokong’u, na kobotongia omorero, bakabosiria amo n’abanto bonsi b’omoorobiri oria. Abwo bonsi, abanto koreng’ana elifu eyemo, abasacha n’abakuungu, bagakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Abimeleki akageenda Tebesi, akayonaaria na koyoira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omoorobiri omokong’u norenge ase omochie oria ime, n’abanto bonsi b’omochie, abasacha n’abakuungu, bagatama gochiao, bagesiekera imeo. Erio bakariina gochia kerama igoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimeleki agacha koumokera omoorobiri oyio, agaika ang’e n’egesieri kiaye ayosambe n’omorero,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na omokungu oyomo akaruta ensio agosera, agaaka Abimeleki omotwe, agasenyenta ekeore kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abimeleki akarangeria omosae obogoretie ebirwanero biaye, akamoteebia, “Somora omoyio oo o birende, ong’ite, abanto tibaabaisa goteeba ng’a: N’omokuungu omoita.” Erio omosae oria akamobeta omoyio oye, akamoita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaisraeli barooche ng’a Abimeleki okuure, bakairana ’nka, kera oyomo goika bwoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.55"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo ekaba ng’a Nyasae oakanire egesiomba ase engencho y’ebibe biria Abimeleki akorerete ise ase ogoita abana baye, abamura bamwabo omonyene, emerongo etano n’ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 9:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae akagera abanto ba Sekemu bakanyora egesusuro as’engeencho y’obonyamuma b’abwo. Naboigo okoragereria kwa Yotamu, mosinto o Yerubi‐Baali, kogaikeranigwa igoro yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
